{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/5a6108140a1352ba2ec75c23c9a020c2.webp?t=1659692213\" width=700 height=60 /></span><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A survival strategy game where you build, craft, gather resources during the day.<br></li><li>Place buildings and design your own city layouts.<br></li><li>The positioning of these buildings can be vital to manage certain resources and affects gameplay. </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/b019dec99428c343e83de7c5fbc3d000.poster.avif?t=1659692213\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/b019dec99428c343e83de7c5fbc3d000.webm?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/b019dec99428c343e83de7c5fbc3d000.mp4?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defend your settlement from monsters like wolves, chupacabra, spiders, and Tribal enemies.<br></li><li>Different bosses for each enemy type. Random enemies are spawned each night.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/85e1dd6827b864edca47e62daa5e150e.poster.avif?t=1659692213\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/85e1dd6827b864edca47e62daa5e150e.webm?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/85e1dd6827b864edca47e62daa5e150e.mp4?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A randomly generated world-map to explore with ships.<br></li><li>Find cities to trade with and random encounters and loot.<br></li><li>We have plans to expand more in the world map post-launch.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/4f36095c20c87103f18676b10afcede9.poster.avif?t=1659692213\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/4f36095c20c87103f18676b10afcede9.webm?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/4f36095c20c87103f18676b10afcede9.mp4?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/5db2451c78e56b83278cd8723ebdaaba.poster.avif?t=1659692213\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/5db2451c78e56b83278cd8723ebdaaba.webm?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155880/extras/5db2451c78e56b83278cd8723ebdaaba.mp4?t=1659692213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Characters</strong></h2></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every character unit has stats such as Strength, agility intelligence.<br></li><li>Every character has unique personality skills. <br></li><li>Managing health, energy, and hunger is key to the survival of units.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 